ust be playing because he doesn't know  enough or because he's too young I want  to be playing because I'm the best guy  for the job and you know so I just never  understood you know no matter where you  go you know I mean in any business you  know you should take the role that yeah  I'm here to be the best that I can be  and help this organization be great but  a big part of that is making sure that  I'm bringing people along and I'm  teaching them the next thing so no  matter where I end up or how long I'm  here that I'm doing the best thing for  the organization that I'm committed to  and so I just to me it just doesn't make  sense today my job isn't you know to do  anything extra to help that young guy  out my job is to win games yeah your  jobs to win games but your job is also  to help everybody around you be better  and that doesn't have to just be your  backup that can be any  buddy on defense could be anybody on the  offensive line I get people mean people  in the front office the head coaches you  go up and talk to him your job is to do  everything you could possibly do to make  your team better so then in the minute I  have left do you think Elway's saying  some of them I mean you know I mean John  is a Pro Football Hall of Fame  quarterback too I mean what do you think  is that yeah I don't know if he's saying  anything to them you know because I  think there are guys that kind of have  that mentality that my job is to do my  job and I understand that part of it I  just think there has to be next-level  thinking and I would think the  organization and a guy like John Elway  would want Joe Flacco to be able to  share that so this quarterback that he's  drafted this year is the next guy and he  doesn't have to go find another one but  I don't know if if those things are  being said because I think a lot of  people understand as a competitor you  know what does your flag or a big bin is  talking about and hey I got a you know  devote everything to what I'm 